## Step 4 — Plan Your Electives Intentionally

**My Intentional Electives:**

1. NE 402 Nuclear Engineering Laboratory
2. NE 421 Introduction to Nuclear Criticality Safety
3. NE 485 Process System Reliability and Safety
4. CYBR 101 Introduction to Cybersecurity Concepts
5. CYBR 201 Introduction to Cryptography and Data Protection
6. CYBR 202 Introduction to Cybersecurity Tools

The nuclear engineering electives would help me build more experience in nuclear safety, criticality safety, and reliability. The cybersecurity courses would allow me to continue developing cybersecurity skills that could potentially be useful when working with the computer and control systems used in nuclear facilities. I would need to discuss these choices with my advisor to determine which cybersecurity courses could fit into my degree plan or count toward an additional certificate.

